1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,908
Al Jazeera reports that Israeli strikes killed four people across Gaza and destroyed a medical supply warehouse.

2
00:00:08,858 --> 00:00:19,064
Gaza health officials condemned the attack on medicine stores, warning that damaged supplies could worsen shortages for hospitals and patients.

3
00:00:19,064 --> 00:00:26,241
The incident adds to concerns about civilians, aid access and fragile ceasefire discussions.

